{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5Gt5hH1HmjBphKqCJz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, scratched with centuries of desperate fingernails and hopeful knocks.*\n\n*A keyhole glows faintly at its center, shaped like no key you've ever seen. It resembles an answer. It resembles a question. It resembles the space between the two.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The lock turns.*\n\n*Not because you had the right key — but because you named the concept itself. The door recognizes the archetype.*\n\n---\n\n**C L I C K**\n\n---\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor lit by something that isn't light. The air tastes like the moment before understanding. The walls are lined with other doors — each waiting for their own word.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*\n\n*What do you carry through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":193,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}